*~

# Claude Code session state — settings.local.json holds per-machine permission
# grants and launch.json is local dev config, so neither belongs in the repo.
# Skills under commands/ ARE shared team knowledge and are tracked deliberately:
# they carry the runbooks, schema traps and honesty rules for recurring work.
# `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`) is required — git cannot re-include a path whose
# parent directory is excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/

# Agent compiled output (rebuild from source)
agent/dist/
.worktrees/

# Agent runtime logs (may contain hub URLs)
agent/*.log
.worktrees/

# Test output
test-results.log

# Deploy artifacts and local verify logs
*.tar
dev-verify*.log

# Superpowers brainstorm visual-companion mockups (not source)
.superpowers/

# Local business / marketing / working documents & backups — kept on disk, not in the code repo
docs/*.docx
docs/*.pdf
Backup docs/

